nd London**, bookings from €5,990 and £5,300, deliveries by October.","**LG Electronics India** — **enters India's chest-freezer market with six convertible models** from 102L to 530L for retail, dairy and food-storage businesses.","**HCL Technologies** — **launches HCLTech Pulse, a business unit for enterprises with US$500 million to US$5 billion of revenue**, to scale AI adoption.","**Sunita Tools** — **receives another advance-payment tranche under its interim sales agreement for NATO-spec 155mm M107 empty shells**; amount not disclosed.","**Aastha Spintex** — acquired unit Falcon Yarns **gets GEDA registration for a 1.35 MW DC rooftop solar plant at Gondal**, with mounting structures about 40% installed.","**Excel Industries** — **wins an EcoVadis Silver sustainability rating**, placing it in the top 15% of companies assessed.","**Computer Age Management Services Limited** — Computer Age Management Services Limited has informed the Exchange regarding a press release dated September 17, 2026, titled \"CAMS Showcases ConsenPro Momentum with Self-Serve DPDP Platform Launch an"],"distress_risk":["**Smaart Tech Services** — **Kripa Anand Rishi Cellular demands repayment of a Rs 129.50 crore inter-corporate loan plus 9.83% interest within 10 days**, threatening legal action; the company is seeking time.","**Bharat Immunologicals & Biologicals** — says the **Government of India has approved its closure**; the company is under the Department of Biotechnology.","**Priority Jewels** — the **CIT(Appeals) deletes the AY2011-12 additions and drops penalty proceedings**, cutting a Rs 3.54 crore tax demand, with a refund of amounts paid due.","**Kalpataru** — the **GST authority appeals to the GST Appellate Tribunal against relief granted to subsidiary Abacus Real Estate** on a Rs 1.36 crore transitional-credit demand; no material impact expected.","**SKIL Infrastructure** — its **11th committee-of-creditors meeting under CIRP is adjourned again, to 21 September**."],"open_offers":["**GSL Securities Ltd** — open offer PA (PA is scanned — open the filing); mcap Rs 16 cr"],"credit_rating_changes":["**SG Mart** — CRISIL **upgrades its bank facilities to Crisil AA-/Stable and A1+ from Crisil A and A1**, removing the positive watch after control passed to Sanjay Gupta of APL Apollo.","**ESDS Software Solution** — CRISIL **upgrades its long-term facilities to A-/Positive from BBB+/Positive and short-term to A2+ from A2**."],"other_notable":["**Emami** — board approves an **open-market buyback of up to Rs 282 crore at a maximum Rs 475 a share**, at least 75% of it to be spent, promoters excluded _(~1.8% of mcap)_.","**Brahmaputra Infrastructure** — its BIL-GKCPL joint venture is **declared lowest bidder at Rs 89.73 crore for a 1,606-metre bridge over the Ravi in Punjab**; the letter of award is awaited.","**Viviana Power Tech Limited** — Viviana Power Tech Limited has informed the Exchange about Confirmation of L1 Stage Successful Bidder for conversion of overhead 11 kV HT lines into underground cable networks with Ring Main System at"]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"DIACABS","ticker":"DIACABS","company":"Diamond Power Infrastructure Limited","isin":"INE989C01020","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/DIACABS_17092026125851_Regulation_30-Receipt_of_Letter_of_Award.pdf","mcap":22490.5},{"label":"JISLDVREQS","ticker":"JISLDVREQS","company":"Jain Irrigation Systems Limited","isin":"IN9175A01010","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/JISLDVREQS_17092026133944_SE_Letter_Press_Release_MSEDCL_.pdf","